<!-- WHAT WE ARE NOT -->
<section class="cx-problem cx-section" id="not-list">
  <div class="cx-container">
    <div class="r">
      <div class="cx-eyebrow">How We Are Different</div>
      <h2 class="cx-h2">Not the typical contractor.<br>Not even close.</h2>
      <p class="cx-sub" style="max-width:580px">Every contractor in this industry describes themselves the same way. Here is what VNG actually does differently — and why it matters to the people who hire us.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cx-not-list stagger">
      <div class="cx-not-item r">
        <div class="cx-not-bad">Big-box firm</div>
        <div class="cx-not-good">Specialist crew</div>
        <h3>You are not a file number.</h3>
        <p>Large GC firms assign junior PMs to your project. VNG puts experienced operators on site from day one who know the job, know the trades, and know how to solve problems without escalating everything up a chain of command.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-not-item r">
        <div class="cx-not-bad">Solo operator</div>
        <div class="cx-not-good">Scalable capacity</div>
        <h3>We can actually deliver at scale.</h3>
        <p>A single carpenter with a handful of subs cannot run a 10,000 sq ft project and keep it on schedule. VNG has the team depth to mobilize additional crews mid-project when timelines demand it — not just the intention to try.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-not-item r">
        <div class="cx-not-bad">Low-price bidder</div>
        <div class="cx-not-good">Transparent value</div>
        <h3>No hidden costs, no change order ambush.</h3>
        <p>The cheapest bid always looks good until the change orders arrive. VNG quotes are itemized, exclusions are listed explicitly, and conditions that could affect scope are flagged upfront. You know what you are paying for before we start.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-not-item r">
        <div class="cx-not-bad">Generalist contractor</div>
        <div class="cx-not-good">Interior specialist</div>
        <h3>Deep expertise in commercial interiors.</h3>
        <p>We do not build houses. We do not do site work. We specialize in commercial interior execution — tenant improvements, fit-outs, medical renovations, restaurant builds — and that focus makes us better at all of it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-not-item r">
        <div class="cx-not-bad">Reactive project management</div>
        <div class="cx-not-good">Proactive coordination</div>
        <h3>We call you before things become problems.</h3>
        <p>Most contractors call when something has already gone wrong. VNG identifies risks in advance — permit delays, long-lead items, spatial conflicts between trades — and re-sequences work before your timeline takes a hit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="cx-not-item r">
        <div class="cx-not-bad">Subcontractor dependency</div>
        <div class="cx-not-good">In-house core trades</div>
        <h3>The work we quote is work we do.</h3>
        <p>Our core trades — framing, drywall, demolition, finishing — are in-house. That means direct accountability, consistent quality, and no communication gaps between the company you hired and the crew doing the work.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

